    key: "AZ3-095",
    domainCode: 3,
    stem: `A media company operates dozens of alert rules across its Azure environment. Whenever any alert fires, the same response must happen: two on-call engineers receive email and text messages, and a Logic App opens a support ticket. The team wants to define this response once and attach it to current and future alert rules. What should they create?`,
